# Keep the build context small and secrets out of the image.
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets / local env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.taktline-tokens.json

# Dependencies + build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Local-only artifacts
backend/uploads
book/
linkedin/
docs/
*.md
!backend/alembic/README
Taktline integrations map*
